 "A chronicler for your World of Warcraft characters. While you play, it keeps what they live: where they went, whom they met, what they fought, found and said. Afterwards it gives it back as their story, in a diary they write themselves, and as a record you can look through day by day.": "一位为你的《魔兽世界》角色执笔的史官。你游戏时，它记下他们的经历：去过哪里、遇见了谁、与什么交战、找到了什么、说过什么。之后，它把这一切还给你：化作他们亲笔写下的日记，以及一份可以逐日翻阅的记录。",
 "A daily entry your character writes about what they lived, and can read aloud.": "角色每天写下一篇日记，记述当天的经历，还能朗读出来。",
 "All your characters as one household.": "你的所有角色，同属一个家族。",
 "Ctrl+K searches quests, players and items from anywhere. F5 reads everything again. This page stays under Help, next to Settings.": "在任何页面按 Ctrl+K 都能搜索任务、玩家和物品。按 F5 重新读取全部内容。本页一直在“帮助”中，就在“设置”旁边。",
 "Empty pockets": "囊中空空",
 "Every coin {name} earns or spends and every item that passes through the bags is counted here.": "{name}赚到或花掉的每一枚钱币，经过背包的每一件物品，都会记在这里。",
 "Every death, its last seconds, and an epitaph.": "每一次死亡、最后的几秒，以及一篇墓志铭。",
 "Every quest with its text and rewards, and what each NPC said.": "每个任务的文本与奖励，以及每个 NPC 说过的话。",
 "Every session, moment by moment.": "每个游戏时段，一刻一刻地记下。",
 "Everyone met, their roleplay profiles, the fellowship and the nemeses.": "遇见过的每个人、他们的角色扮演档案、同伴与宿敌。",
 "Everything is kept on this computer, in a folder you choose. The diary is written by the AI tool you already use, from the recorded facts alone; other players' chat is never sent.": "一切都保存在这台电脑上，在你选择的文件夹里。日记由你已在使用的 AI 工具撰写，只依据记录下的事实；其他玩家的聊天内容从不外传。",
 "Feats earned along the way, some for their class alone.": "一路上达成的壮举，有些为其职业独有。",
 "Fights, abilities and the seconds before each death.": "战斗、技能，以及每次死亡前的那几秒。",
 "Forever Memory copies it into your archive, a folder that keeps every day for good, with its history and an optional backup. It keeps doing so while the app is closed, if you let it.": "Forever Memory 会把它复制到你的档案中：一个永久保存每一天的文件夹，附带完整历史和可选的备份。只要你允许，应用关闭时它也会继续这样做。",
 "Gear, talents and the character sheet.": "装备、天赋和角色面板。",
 "Help": "帮助",
 "How it works": "工作原理",
 "Levels, gold and time at a glance.": "等级、金币和游戏时长，一目了然。",
 "Look back: the day in your character's own words, read aloud if you wish, their chronicle and letters, and every number behind them.": "回顾过往：用角色自己的话讲述的这一天，想听便可朗读；还有他们的编年史与书信，以及背后的每一个数字。",
 "Look for the yellow marks. Every quest {name} takes is kept here, with its text, its rewards and how it went.": "留意那些黄色的感叹号。{name}接下的每个任务都会保存在这里，连同任务文本、奖励和经过。",
