 "No faction has taken notice of {name} yet. Standing is kept from addon 0.4.0 on; log in once with it.": "还没有哪个阵营注意到{name}。插件从 0.4.0 版起记录声望；用它登录一次即可。",
 "No item by that name went through the bags.": "没有这个名字的物品经过背包。",
