 "Show my characters": "查看我的角色",
 "Streamers: \"Previously on…\" on the Diary page reads the last entry aloud in your character's voice while the stream is starting.": "主播：“日记”页面上的“前情提要……”会在直播开场时，用角色的声音朗读最新一篇日记。",
 "The armory addon notes what your character does: quests, loot, gold, places, the people met and what they said. The game itself logs every fight.": "armory 插件会记下角色的所作所为：任务、拾取、金币、地点、遇见的人以及他们说的话。每场战斗则由游戏自己记录。",
